    "why_the_first_fix_was_insufficient": "Gating only the axlivemon instance saved 1,511 LUT4 and left 18,743 \u2014 still 550 above the 18,193 that placed at 6ad8a4c. The decode, the command validation and the 64-bit read muxes 77553a2 added to axroleiso were still being synthesised."
